        {
          "name": "Create Booking",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{seekerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\r\n  \"workspaceId\": \"{{workspaceId}}\",\r\n  \"startTime\": \"2026-08-03T14:00:00Z\",\r\n  \"endTime\": \"2026-08-03T16:00:00Z\",\r\n  \"totalAmount\": 5000\r\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bookings",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "bookings"
              ]
            },
            "description": "# POST /api/bookings\n\nCreates a booking.\n\n**Authorization:** `Bearer {{seekerToken}}`\n\n## Request Body\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"workspaceId\": \"{{workspaceId}}\",\n  \"startTime\": \"2026-08-03T14:00:00Z\",\n  \"endTime\": \"2026-08-03T16:00:00Z\",\n  \"totalAmount\": 5000\n}\n\n ```\n\n## Success Response (201)\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"message\": \"Booking created successfully. Pending payment confirmation.\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"booking\": {\n      \"id\": \"...\",\n      \"workspace_id\": \"...\",\n      \"seeker_id\": \"...\",\n      \"start_time\": \"...\",\n      \"end_time\": \"...\",\n      \"mode\": \"instant\",\n      \"status\": \"confirmed\",\n      \"checkin_code\": \"397812\",\n      \"total_amount\": \"5000.00\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n ```\n\n## Error Responses\n\n### 409 Conflict\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"status\": \"error\",\n  \"message\": \"Selected time slot is no longer available.\"\n}\n\n ```\n\n### 403 Forbidden\n\n- Corporate budget exceeded\n    \n- User not authorized\n    \n\n### 400 Bad Request\n\n- Workspace not found\n    \n- Workspace not currently bookable\n    \n\n## Concurrency Test\n\nThis endpoint uses database transactions with row-level locking (`SELECT ... FOR UPDATE`) to prevent double booking.\n\nTo verify:\n\n1. Obtain a valid seeker token.\n    \n2. Send two `POST /api/bookings` requests simultaneously using the same `workspaceId`, `startTime`, and `endTime`.\n    \n3. Expected result:\n    \n    - One request returns **201 Created**.\n        \n    - The other returns **409 Conflict** with the message:  \n        `\"Selected time slot is no longer available.\"`\n        \n\nA reusable `concurrency-test.js` script is available in the project root for this test."
          },
          "response": []
        },
